WEBVTT

00:02:30.627 --> 00:02:32.294
So why do I feel this way?

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:35.210
Well ...

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:41.079
Someone with credible accusations
of sexual violence against him

00:02:41.103 --> 00:02:44.753
was confirmed to the Supreme Court
of the United States of America,

00:02:46.153 --> 00:02:47.303
again.

00:02:48.973 --> 00:02:50.343
The US President,

00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:54.859
who was caught on tape talking
about how he can grab women's body parts

00:02:54.883 --> 00:02:57.560
wherever he wants, however he wants,

00:02:57.584 --> 00:03:00.332
can call a survivor a liar
at one of his rallies,